  "body": "# v1.17.2\r\n\r\n## Clipboard over SSH (OSC 52)\r\n\r\n- No clipboard tool on the host (usual over SSH), so yank failed:\r\n\r\n```text\r\nClipboard unavailable; saved in editor register\r\n```\r\n\r\n- Now the text goes to your terminal with OSC 52 and lands on your local clipboard:\r\n\r\n```text\r\nCopied selection. Sent via OSC 52\r\n```\r\n\r\n- Editor yank, delete, change and response pane copy.\r\n- Only when the clipboard tool fails. Working tool, no change.\r\n- Works by default in Kitty, Ghostty, WezTerm, Alacritty, foot, Windows Terminal.\r\n- iTerm2: Settings > General > Selection > \"Applications in terminal may access clipboard\".\r\n- Not supported: macOS Terminal, GNOME Terminal.\r\n- tmux: `set -g set-clipboard on`\r\n- Paste unchanged. `p` uses the editor register, terminal paste in insert mode uses your clipboard.\r\n\r\n[Troubleshooting](https://resterm.app/docs/troubleshooting/)\r\n\r\n## `osc52_limit`\r\n\r\n- Default 1 MiB, about 768 KB of text. Bigger copies stay in the editor register:\r\n\r\n```text\r\nToo large for OSC 52 (limit 1 MiB). Saved in editor register\r\n```\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[clipboard]\r\nosc52_limit = \"8MiB\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n- JSON: `{\"clipboard\":{\"osc52_limit\":\"8MiB\"}}`\r\n- Raise it for Kitty. `16KiB` for mosh.\r\n- `KB`, `KiB`, `MB`, `MiB`, `GB`, `GiB`, all powers of two. Must be greater than zero.\r\n\r\n[Configuration](https://resterm.app/docs/configuration/#clipboard)\r\n\r\n## Broken settings file no longer overwritten\r\n\r\n- A file that failed to load, for example `diagnostics = 'yes'`, was replaced with defaults on the next theme change or layout save (`g L`).\r\n- With `settings.json`, a new `settings.toml` was written and the JSON file was ignored after that.\r\n- Now the save is refused and the status line shows why:\r\n\r\n```text\r\nlayout save error: settings not saved: parse settings \"/home/you/.config/resterm/settings.toml\": toml: cannot decode TOML string into struct field config.EditorSettings.Diagnostics of type *bool\r\n```\r\n\r\n- Fix the file and restart.\r\n\r\n## Mock server, recorder and OAuth\r\n\r\n- `:mock restart`, `:mock stop`, the toggle key and quitting hung 3s:\r\n\r\n```text\r\nMock server stop failed: context deadline exceeded\r\n```\r\n\r\n- Stopping the recorder: same 3s, `Recorder stopped: context deadline exceeded`.\r\n- OAuth auth code login: about 5s extra after \"Authentication complete\" in the browser.\r\n- Cause: a connection that never sent a request (Go 1.27 clients, browsers). Resterm waited about 5s for it.\r\n- Requests in progress still finish."
